        "snippet": "Duluth Holdings (DLTH) Q1 2026 Results: Net Loss Narrows, Gross Margin Expands, Adjusted EBITDA Guidance Raised – Minichart\n\nSign in to continue:\n\n×\n\nMonday, June 15th, 2026\n\n# Duluth Holdings (DLTH) Q1 2026 Results: Net Loss Narrows, Gross Margin Expands, Adjusted EBITDA Guidance Raised\n\n315\n\nViews\n\nDuluth Holdings Inc. Q1 2026 Financial Results: In-Depth Analysis\n\n# Duluth Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: DLTH) Reports Q1 2026 Financial Results: Profitability and Liquidity Improve Amid Lower Sales\n\n## Key Highlights and Investor Implications\n\nDate: June 8, 2026 Location: Mount Horeb, Wisconsin\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n- Net Loss Narrows Significantly: Q1 2026 net loss improved to \\$10.0 million, down from \\$15.3 million in Q1 2025. This is a substantial \\$5.2 million improvement.\n- Adjusted EBITDA Turns Positive: Adjusted EBITDA rose by \\$6.4 million year-over-year to \\$2.6 million, showing meaningful operational progress.\n- Gross Margin Expansion: Gross margin surged by 540 basis points to 57.4",
